# Custom Match street race in Tokyo at night, Shinjuku Kabukicho Loop, 2 laps, Enzo Ferrari:
# Single Player -> Custom Match -> Street Race, the city grid's default (Tokyo) and route, the
# weather one step right of Clear (rain), Lobby -> Start, then full throttle. Its start lights
# are the brightest emissive colors of the routes here (above 7e3's 31.875). Run it with
# --race-draws 2000 (the race draws about 2900 per frame). Needs a fresh save and title update 2,
# which adds World Challenge to the Single Player menu. Taps of 300 ms move menus twice.
30000 return          # skip the intro FMV
+12000 return         # title: PRESS START -> Gamer Profiles
+8000 space           # Next -> Select Driver
+8000 d 300           # right-hand driver
+1800 space           # -> Select Nationality
+8000 space           # -> Driver customisation
+8000 space           # Continue -> Main Menu
+20000 space          # Single Player -> Arcade Mode
+6000 d 60            # -> Gotham Career
+2000 d 60            # -> World Challenge
+2000 d 60            # -> Time Attack
+2000 d 60            # -> Custom Match
+3000 space           # -> Street Race / Eliminator
+7000 space           # Street Race -> Options (City highlighted)
+5000 space           # City grid (Tokyo highlighted)
+3000 space           # Tokyo -> Options
+4000 shift+down 100  # -> Route
+2000 shift+down 60   # -> Weather
+3000 space           # weather grid (Clear highlighted)
+4000 shift+right 60  # -> rain
+3000 space           # -> Options
+6000 shift+down 100
+2000 shift+down 100
+2000 shift+down 100  # -> Lobby
+3000 space           # Lobby
+7000 return          # Start: loading, race starts on its own
+25000 mark loaded
+0 e 60000            # full throttle
+0 mark throttle
+5000 mark race
